up.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0010020000</span>10,020<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Weapons_Shipment\" title=\"The Weapons Shipment\">The Weapons Shipment</a></b>, End chest (main objective)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Crippling\" title=\"Crippling\">Crippling</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Crippling\" title=\"Crippling\">Crippling</a>:</b> A crippling weapon is infused with binding power so that when a target is critically hit their movement is slowed by half.<br /><i>Note: Real slowdown is only 25%</i></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Seeker\" title=\"Seeker\"> Seeker +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Seeker\" title=\"Seeker\"> Seeker +4</a>:</b> Provides a +4 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to confirm critical hits, and a +4 Enhancement bonus to critical hit damage (before multipliers are applied).</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Attack_bonus\" title=\"Attack bonus\">Attack Bonus +2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Attack_bonus\" title=\"Attack bonus\">Attack Bonus +2</a>:</b> Provides a +2 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">competence bonus</a> to your <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack rolls</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Shimmering_Arrowhead.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Shimmering_Arrowhead.png/420px-Shimmering_Arrowhead.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"321\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Shimmering_Arrowhead.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This arrowhead is made from an unusual material that hums slightly and radiates power.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817061453\nCac